- Use Hugging Face Transformers for state-of-the-art NLP and multimodal AI models.
- Select appropriate pre-trained models based on task requirements and resource constraints.
- Implement proper tokenization and preprocessing pipelines for consistent model inputs.
- Use pipeline abstractions for common tasks like text classification and generation.
- Implement proper fine-tuning procedures with appropriate hyperparameters and datasets.
- Use model parallelism and gradient accumulation for training large models efficiently.
- Implement proper evaluation metrics and validation strategies for model performance.
- Use appropriate optimization techniques like LoRA or QLoRA for efficient fine-tuning.
- Deploy models with proper inference optimization and hardware acceleration.
- Monitor model performance and implement model versioning for production systems.
